General thoughts on the project and original ideas.

Create client and server

Source: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wW2A5SZ3GkI
What is HTTP? How the Internet Works! #1

HTTP request for client and server

HTTP Request
- Start Line
   - Method, usually GET or POST
   - Target, file
   - Version, the http version, like HTTP/1.0
- Headers
   - addition information, e.g. User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0
- Body 
   - Typically what the server uses to send back the files
   - Request here would usually be like None for GET

HTTP Response
- Start Line
   - Version, Same http version
   - Status Codes, like Error codes or OK
   - Status Text
- Headers
   - Server information for what was requested
- Body
   - File

HTTP is called a STATELESS protocol
   - When client sends request and server sends response
      - There isn't a maintained connection, refreshing needs another request
   - TCP/IP protocol
   - 3 parts to request/response


I'm using actix_web's framework because it looks simple

According to actix_web:
   "Request handlers use async functions that accept zero or more parameters"
   - Using asynchronous functions allows users to do multiple things at once
